# UART vs SPI

Building both UART and SPI helped demonstrate the difference between asynchronous and synchronous serial communication.

| Feature       | UART            | SPI               |
|---------------|-----------------|-------------------|
|  Clock        | No shared clock | Shared clock      |
| Communication | Asynchronous    | Synchronous       |
| Wires         | TX/RX           | SCLK/MOSI/MISO/CS |
| Full Duplex   | Yes             | Yes               |
| Master/Slave  | No              | Yes               |
| Typical Speed | Lower           | Higher            |

